@TrilhaDaMultiplicacaoAPI_HostAddress = http://localhost:5271

### Registrar aluno
POST {{TrilhaDaMultiplicacaoAPI_HostAddress}}/api/auth/registrar
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nome": "Ana Teste",
  "email": "ana@teste.com",
  "senha": "123456"
}

### Login
# @name login
POST {{TrilhaDaMultiplicacaoAPI_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ana@teste.com",
  "senha": "123456"
}

### Perfil do aluno autenticado
GET {{TrilhaDaMultiplicacaoAPI_HostAddress}}/api/alunos/me
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

### Atualizar perfil
PUT {{TrilhaDaMultiplicacaoAPI_HostAddress}}/api/alunos/me
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nome": "Ana Silva",
  "email": "ana@teste.com",
  "avatarEmoji": "🐱"
}

### Registrar conclusão da fase 1
POST {{TrilhaDaMultiplicacaoAPI_HostAddress}}/api/progresso/fases/1
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "estrelas": 3
}

### Obter progresso do aluno
GET {{TrilhaDaMultiplicacaoAPI_HostAddress}}/api/progresso
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

### Obter ranking
GET {{TrilhaDaMultiplicacaoAPI_HostAddress}}/api/ranking
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

### Obter conquistas
GET {{TrilhaDaMultiplicacaoAPI_HostAddress}}/api/conquistas
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

###
